.TH LOSLES 1 "July 2026" "losles" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
losles \- color-managed image viewer with lossless editing
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B losles
.RI [ FILE ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B losles
is a lightweight GTK image viewer for JPEG and PNG files.
It converts an embedded image profile directly to the ICC profile selected
for the active monitor and supports wide-gamut RGB display profiles.
.PP
Supported images can be rotated and cropped without changing their JPEG
coefficients or PNG sample values.
Rotation overwrites the original file.
Crop moves the exact original to the system Trash before installing the
cropped replacement.
.SH KEYBOARD SHORTCUTS
.TP
.B Ctrl+O
Open an image.
.TP
.B Left, Right
Show the previous or next image.
.TP
.B I
Toggle the image information overlay.
.TP
.B C
Enter or leave crop mode.
.TP
.B Enter
Apply the current crop selection.
.TP
.B Escape
Leave crop mode, or reset a zoomed image to its fitted size.
.TP
.B Alt+Enter
Enter or leave fullscreen mode.
.TP
.B Delete
Move the current image to the system Trash.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B G_MESSAGES_DEBUG=losles
Enable diagnostic messages about monitor and colord profile selection.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /usr/share/applications/io.github.develancer.losles.desktop
Desktop launcher and image MIME associations.
.TP
.I /usr/share/metainfo/io.github.develancer.losles.metainfo.xml
AppStream software-catalogue metadata.
